    "overview": "The Ant Esports AEC810 is an 8-in-1 USB-C docking station that turns a single port into a full workstation hub, combining HDMI 2.0 output, an RJ-45 Ethernet port, USB 3.0 and USB 2.0 ports, SD/TF card slots and a PD 3.0 charging port. The HDMI port delivers 4K@30Hz output for monitors, HDTVs or projectors, while the built-in Ethernet port adds a stable, fast wired internet connection where Wi-Fi isn't reliable. A PD 3.0 charging pass-through keeps your laptop, phone or tablet powered while docked, and the compact, sleek design suits any workspace. Universal compatibility spans Windows, Mac, Linux and Android, making the AEC810 a genuinely complete connectivity hub for daily productivity.",
